### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 18 - ADMIN REST RESOURCES
###
### Tests for administrative resources including:
###   1. Behavioral Directives (self-evolve) CRUD, synthesis, reconciliation
###   2. System Prompt Registry CRUD, cache refreshing
###   3. Tiered Memory Admin: Core, Archival, Recall
###
### Prerequisites: Amsha Agent running in serve mode
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl    = http://localhost:8080
@validKey   = key-internal-changeme
@ciKey      = key-ci-changeme

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW A: BEHAVIORAL DIRECTIVES (SELF-EVOLVE)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN-DIR-1] List directives
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-2] Synthesize directives (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-3] Synthesize directives (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/synthesize
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-4] Reconcile directives (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-DIR-5] Reconcile directives (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/directives/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW B: SYSTEM PROMPT REGISTRY CRUD
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN-PRM-1] List prompts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-2] Create prompt (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

{
    "roleId": "coordinator",
    "sectionKey": "test_section",
    "content": "This is a test prompt content.",
    "version": 1,
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "rolloutPercentage": 100
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-3] Create prompt (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 201 Created with Location header
# @name createPrompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "roleId": "coordinator",
    "sectionKey": "test_section",
    "content": "This is a test prompt content.",
    "version": 1,
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "rolloutPercentage": 100
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-4] Get specific prompt
# Expect 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-5] Update prompt (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

{
    "content": "Updated test prompt content."
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-6] Update prompt (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "content": "Updated test prompt content."
}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-7] Refresh cache
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/refresh
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-8] Delete prompt (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-PRM-9] Delete prompt (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/prompts/test_section
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW C: TIERED MEMORY ADMIN
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Core Memory Blocks ---

### [ADMIN-MEM-CORE-1] List core memory blocks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/core
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-CORE-2] Upsert block (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/core/test_block
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

{
    "content": "test block content"
}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-CORE-3] Upsert block (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/core/test_block
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "content": "test block content"
}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-CORE-4] Get specific block
# Expect 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/core/test_block
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-CORE-5] Delete block (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/core/test_block
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-CORE-6] Delete block (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/core/test_block
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# --- Archival Memory Chunks ---

### [ADMIN-MEM-ARCH-1] Search archival memory chunks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/archival/search?query=test
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-ARCH-2] Evict low-confidence chunks (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/archival/evict?threshold=0.5&minAgeDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-ARCH-3] Evict low-confidence chunks (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/archival/evict?threshold=0.5&minAgeDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

# --- Recall Memory Messages ---

### [ADMIN-MEM-RCL-1] Search recall memory messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/recall/search?query=test
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-RCL-2] Purge recall memory messages (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/recall/purge?retentionDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

###

### [ADMIN-MEM-RCL-3] Purge recall memory messages (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/memory/recall/purge?retentionDays=30
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW D: READ-ONLY DATABASE CONSOLE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN-DB-1] Execute read-only query (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/db/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

{
    "sql": "SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table' LIMIT 5;"
}

###

### [ADMIN-DB-2] Execute read-only query (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK: {"columns":[...],"rows":[...],"executionMs":...}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/db/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "sql": "SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table' LIMIT 5;"
}

###

### [ADMIN-DB-3] Reject mutating DML query (authorized internal key)
# Expect 400 Bad Request: DML statements are forbidden in read-only console
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/db/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "sql": "DELETE FROM audit_event WHERE 1=1;"
}

###


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLOW E: MODEL ARENA BENCHMARKING
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [ADMIN-ARENA-1] Compare models in arena (unauthorized with CI key)
# Expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/arena/compare
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{ciKey}}

{
    "prompt": "What is the capital of France?",
    "models": ["gemini", "groq"]
}

###

### [ADMIN-ARENA-2] Compare models in arena (authorized with internal key)
# Expect 200 OK: {"results":[...],"totalDurationMs":...}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/arena/compare
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "prompt": "What is the capital of France?",
    "models": ["gemini", "groq"]
}

###

### [ADMIN-ARENA-3] Reject prompt with credentials / API keys (fail-closed)
# Expect 400 Bad Request: prompt contains sensitive credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/arena/compare
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "prompt": "Here is my secret: sk-1234567890abcdef1234567890abcd",
    "models": ["gemini"]
}

###

